    "title": "(AMZN-NLN) SoundPEATS Truengine 3 SE 3SE (UPGRADE VERSION QC3040) True Wireless Earbuds Bluetooth Dual Mic CVC 8.0 aptX Dual Dynamic Drivers with Crossover Smart Touch",
    "body_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-mce-style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff2a00;\">As our store also sell on amazon, we do receive returns from the customers by stating reason as \"No longer needed\" called as AMZN-NLN. The products sold in this collection are UNUSED, in almost new - 100% working condition. So, here is an opportunity for our customers to experience the best at deeply discounted prices :)</span></strong></p>\n<div align=\"start\"><span><strong data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2g0o.detail.1000023.i0.4e752dcfrnHz7J\">Features:</strong></span></div>\n<div align=\"start\"><span>[Dual Dynamic Drivers with Crossover] - The combination of titanium-plated speaker and composite diaphragm speaker offers authentic sound with crystal clear treble and deep bass. The unique crossovers can provide fantastic and powerful music with lossless audio</span></div>\n<div align=\"start\"><span>[Bluetooth 5.2 &amp; QCC3040 Chipset]- Adopt advanced Bluetooth 5.2 and built-in high-tech QCC 3040 chipset, SoundPEATS Sonic is compatible with all the Bluetooth devices enable with Bluetooth 4.0 or above and provides you truly wireless enjoyment with seamless connection and lower consumption. You can choose either earbud at a time for calls or music, switch freely between single and twin mode.</span></div>\n<div align=\"start\"><span>[Smart Touch Control &amp; Mini Size] - Instead of the discomfort by button control, the sensitive touch control can effectively reduce the pain of wearing headphones and easily achieve all functions of your device. The upgraded design makes the earphone smaller and lighter</span></div>\n<div align=\"start\"><span>[30 Hours Duration &amp; USB-C] - One full charge will deliver 6.5 hours playtime and will provide an additional 30 hours with 4 times recharge from the portable compact charging case. The charging port is upgraded to USB-C, which is more convenient and applicable</span></div>\n<div align=\"start\"><span>[Dual Mic &amp; Worry-free Warranty] - Built-in dual microphones with noise cancellation for you to enjoy crystal-clear hands-free calls and voice assistant even in noisy circumstances.</span></div>\n<div align=\"start\"><br></div>\n<div align=\"start\"><span><strong>Specification:</strong></span></div>\n<div align=\"start\"><span>1. Brand: SoundPEATS</span></div>\n<div align=\"start\"><span>2. Model: SoundPEATS Truengine 3 SE</span></div>\n<div align=\"start\"><span>3. Special Features: Dual Dynamic Drivers, QCC3040 Bluetooth 5.2 Chip, Qualcomm aptX Adaptive, Dual Mic, Qualcomm cVc8.0 Noise Cancellation, in-Ear Earphone , 30 Hours Playtime, IPX5, Smart Touch, Type C Charge, Crossovers\uff0cGame Mode</span></div>\n<div align=\"start\"><span>4. Microphone: Yes</span></div>\n<div align=\"start\"><span>5. Microphone Technology: Bidirectional</span></div>\n<p>\u00a0<img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Hd6baa105294748c9ab2c711f2fd5363d5.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" alt=\"(amzn-nln) soundpeats truengine 3 se 3se (upgrade version qc3040) true wireless earbuds bluetooth dual mic cvc 8.0 aptx dual dynamic drivers\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H5d66cde5a83b4be391b48535aaa1d198Q.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" alt=\"(amzn-nln) soundpeats truengine 3 se 3se (upgrade version qc3040) true wireless earbuds bluetooth dual mic cvc 8.0 aptx dual dynamic drivers\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H5b6c64e4d87f444dac94a9d49dab4b6dt.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" alt=\"(amzn-nln) soundpeats truengine 3 se 3se (upgrade version qc3040) true wireless earbuds bluetooth dual mic cvc 8.0 aptx dual dynamic drivers\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H3533c4431ad24be7af688da898bc9ba2T.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" alt=\"(amzn-nln) soundpeats truengine 3 se 3se (upgrade version qc3040) true wireless earbuds bluetooth dual mic cvc 8.0 aptx dual dynamic drivers\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H1a665